{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01LBArgRaQ9bfouMHXj5zUAN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough grounded material. I read the two principal synthesis deliverables (the 8-page transcript-grounded summary and the Dean-facing Executive Summary), the research/scrape pipeline (`.research-symposium/`, with its own `RESEARCH_REPORT.md` documenting an authenticated-HTTP-mirror methodology), and the project's Anchor metadata. Two cross-document defects are directly observable, the coverage-honesty of the full summary is a genuine strength, and the `.research-symposium/` working tree (untracked per `git status`, not ignored) contains a `session` cookie / `sess.json` / auth logs.\n\nEmitting the RAW draft per the runtime contract (no self-assigned tiers/stamps — the host's seam pass applies them):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"gandalf.raw-draft.v1\",\n  \"cross_model\": false,\n  \"degraded\": true,\n  \"degraded_legs\": [\n    {\n      \"leg\": \"situate\",\n      \"why\": \"researchPrime was NOT commissioned in this single-context Tier-1 run. The one situate elevation below is a candidate cross-field frame offered as needs_verification, not a CORROBORATED/OBSERVED fact. Any best-in-class framing is UNVERIFIED.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"leg\": \"substrate\",\n      \"why\": \"Single-family host (cross_model:false). Refuter/judge are a conservative lower bound; GROUNDED is unreachable here — PROMISING is the ceiling.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reasoning\": \"TRIAGE. The artifact is MIXED: (a) a data-collection pipeline under .research-symposium/ that authenticates to symposium.guetta.com, mirrors slides/videos, transcribes with Whisper large-v3, cross-checks against Vimeo auto-captions, and (b) a set of synthesized deliverables — an 8-page session-by-session 'Symposium Summary', a 1-page Dean-facing 'Executive Summary', a supplemental report, a Columbia teaching brief, and a standalone Ipeirotis